{"absolutePath":"/home/arcka/code/owo/lat.md/formats.md","content":"# Formats\n\nThe on-disk formats the code reads and writes. They follow `docs/design.md` sections 3 and 4.\n\n## Identity layout\n\nAn identity is `<root>/<slug>/` with `identity.json`, `soul/`, `life/` and `work/`; `owo new` creates every folder and file listed here.\n\n- `soul/`: `soul.json` (SoulSpec v0.5), `state.json`, `IDENTITY.md`, `SOUL.md`, `VOICE.md`, `LOOK.md`, `MEMORY.md`, `examples/{good,bad,greetings}.md`.\n- `life/`: `state.json`, `_index.md`, `timeline.md`, and one folder per category: characters, locations, cultures, factions, events, eras, threads, conflicts, lessons, writing, log, journal.\n- `work/`: `state.json`, `README.md`, `_index.md`, `projects/<p>/project.md`, `projects/<p>/notes/YYYY-MM-DD_<slug>.md`.\n\n## Entry frontmatter\n\nEvery life and work entry has YAML frontmatter with `type`, `title`, `aliases`, `summary`, `status`, `created`, `updated`, `sources`. Lists are block lists (`  - item`); an empty list is `[]`.\n\nCitations live only in frontmatter: `sources` (paths relative to `sources/`, optional `#L<a>-L<b>`, or plain text), lesson `evidence` and thread `from` are links. Bodies have no Sources, Evidence or From section.\n\n`type` must match the folder. `status` is `canon`, `disputed` or `superseded`. Dates are `YYYY-MM-DD`. Dated types (log, journal, writing, note) carry `date`, and the file name must start with it. Events need `date`; threads need `state: open|closed`; conflicts need `state: open|resolved`; location details need `parent`; notes need `project` equal to their project folder.\n\n## Soul files\n\nSoul Markdown files are plain Markdown with no frontmatter; their stamps live in `soul/state.json`.\n\n## State files\n\nEach `state.json` has `files`: a map from scope-relative path to `{created, updated, hash}`. Hashes are `b3:<blake3 hex>` of the file text.\n\n`soul/state.json` adds `history` (soul change trail) and `review` (`last_reviewed`, `reviewed_through`, `memory_hash`). `life/state.json` adds `last_write`. `work/state.json` adds `projects`.\n\n## Generated files\n\nGenerated files start with a marker comment and depend only on entry content, so regeneration is deterministic and comparable.\n\nEach life category `_index.md` lists `- [[Title]]: summary (aliases: ...)`; location details nest under their overview. `life/_index.md` lists categories with counts. `life/timeline.md` groups events under eras sorted by `date`; `era` resolves like any link (title, alias, slug, `|label`). `work/_index.md` lists the profile and projects with note counts.\n\n## Config resolution\n\nRoot resolves from `--root`, `OWO_ROOT`, `root` in the nearest `.owo.toml`, `root` in `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/owo/config.toml`, then `$XDG_DATA_HOME/owo`.\n\nIdentity resolves from `-i`, `OWO_IDENTITY`, `.owo.toml`, user config, then the only identity in the root. Project resolves from `--project`, `OWO_PROJECT`, `.owo.toml`; see [[decisions#Working project versus project filter]]. Relative `root` values resolve against the config file's folder; `~/` expands to `$HOME`.\n\n## Templates\n\nTemplates are embedded in the binary. `<root>/.templates/<name>` overrides one, where `<name>` is the identity-relative path for identity files (`soul/IDENTITY.md`, `work/README.md`) and `<type>.md` for entries (`character.md`).\n\nPlaceholders are `{{name}}`, `{{slug}}`, `{{title}}`, `{{today}}`, `{{date}}`, `{{parent}}`, `{{project}}`. A `{{key_yaml}}` form escapes double quotes for YAML strings.\n","path":"formats.md","projectPath":"lat.md/formats.md","frontmatter":{},"sections":[{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats","heading":"Formats","depth":1,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#Identity layout","heading":"Identity layout","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[],"startLine":5,"endLine":12,"firstParagraph":"An identity is `<root>/<slug>/` with `identity.json`, `soul/`, `life/` and `work/`; `owo new` creates every folder and file listed here.","githubSlug":"identity-layout"},{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#Entry frontmatter","heading":"Entry frontmatter","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[],"startLine":13,"endLine":20,"firstParagraph":"Every life and work entry has YAML frontmatter with `type`, `title`, `aliases`, `summary`, `status`, `created`, `updated`, `sources`. Lists are block lists (`  - item`); an empty list is `[]`.","githubSlug":"entry-frontmatter"},{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#Soul files","heading":"Soul files","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[],"startLine":21,"endLine":24,"firstParagraph":"Soul Markdown files are plain Markdown with no frontmatter; their stamps live in `soul/state.json`.","githubSlug":"soul-files"},{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#State files","heading":"State files","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[],"startLine":25,"endLine":30,"firstParagraph":"Each `state.json` has `files`: a map from scope-relative path to `{created, updated, hash}`. Hashes are `b3:<blake3 hex>` of the file text.","githubSlug":"state-files"},{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#Generated files","heading":"Generated files","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[],"startLine":31,"endLine":36,"firstParagraph":"Generated files start with a marker comment and depend only on entry content, so regeneration is deterministic and comparable.","githubSlug":"generated-files"},{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#Config resolution","heading":"Config resolution","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/formats","filePath":"lat.md/formats.md","children":[],"startLine":37,"endLine":42,"firstParagraph":"Root resolves from `--root`, `OWO_ROOT`, `root` in the nearest `.owo.toml`, `root` in `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/owo/config.toml`, then `$XDG_DATA_HOME/owo`.","githubSlug":"config-resolution"},{"id":"lat.md/formats#Formats#Temp